From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Priestley <voicedrew11@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:52:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dev: VU1 shadow verification against the original interpreter
 (PS2X_VU1_VERIFY)

NOT FOR UPSTREAM. src/lib/vu/ref holds the VU1 interpreter as of the
kfiv branch base, renamed VU1InterpreterRef. With PS2X_VU1_VERIFY=1 every
MSCAL/MSCNT also runs on the reference, on a copy of VU1 data memory, and
the registers, flags, cycle count, VU1 data memory and XGKICK output are
compared after each microprogram ([vu1verify] lines on stderr).
